      "canonical_latex": "\\rho := \\frac{2r}{n a_0},\\quad R_{n\\ell}(r) = \\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{2}{n a_0}\\right)^3\\frac{(n-\\ell-1)!}{2n[(n+\\ell)!]}}\\,e^{-\\rho/2}\\rho^\\ell L_{n-\\ell-1}^{2\\ell+1}(\\rho)\\quad (n \\ge \\ell+1)",
